  "details": "I don't really know what to title this, so apologies if it sounds confusing.\n\nI'm a world mod for Stylized FPE School. We have an Admin Room where admins have access to special pickups/props. I've noticed that there seem to be problems with prop ownership (determined by whoever last held a certain prop). \n\nThe way this world is set up is that each room is set up to be pretty far away from each other. Taking this to consideration, if you are the owner of a prop, and run into another room, whilst not holding the prop (aka, get very far away from it) the prop will \"disappear\" by falling through the world. \n\nI've also noticed that because of this, it will sometime completely break the prop's respawning sync, and will not respawn. Sometimes attempting to respawn the affected prop will \"respawn\" it back to where the prop last was before it fell through the world. \n\nProvided are two videos showing what I am talking about, albeit in low quality. Hope all of this helps!",
